{
  "category": "Vine Pokémon",
  "entries": [
    {
      "text": "It ensnares prey by extending arms made of vines. Losing arms to predators does not trouble it.",
      "version": "diamond"
    },
    {
      "text": "It ensnares prey by extending arms made of vines. Losing arms to predators does not trouble it.",
      "version": "pearl"
    },
    {
      "text": "Its arms are made of plants that bind themselves to things. They grow back right away if cut.",
      "version": "platinum"
    },
    {
      "text": "When it remains still, it appears to be a large shrub. Unsuspecting prey that wander near get ensnared by its vines.",
      "version": "heartgold"
    },
    {
      "text": "Its vines grow so profusely that, in the warm season, you can’t even see its eyes.",
      "version": "soulsilver"
    },
    {
      "text": "Its arms are made of plants that bind themselves to things. They grow back right away if cut.",
      "version": "black"
    },
    {
      "text": "Its arms are made of plants that bind themselves to things. They grow back right away if cut.",
      "version": "white"
    },
    {
      "text": "Even if one of its arms is eaten, it’s fine. The Pokémon regenerates quickly and will go right back to normal.",
      "version": "black-2"
    },
    {
      "text": "Even if one of its arms is eaten, it’s fine. The Pokémon regenerates quickly and will go right back to normal.",
