    {
      "text": "Its vines grow so profusely that, in the warm season, you can’t even see its eyes.",
      "version": "alpha-sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "Tangrowth has two arms that it can extend as it pleases. Recent research has shown that these arms are, in fact, bundles of vines.",
      "version": "sword"
    },
    {
      "text": "Vine growth is accelerated for Tangrowth living in warm climates. If the vines grow long, Tangrowth shortens them by tearing parts of them off.",
      "version": "shield"
    },
    {
      "text": "Draped with long vines, it resembles a shrub in appearance. It swings bundles of vines as though they were arms, wrapping them around prey to ensnare them.",
      "version": "legends-arceus"
    }
